@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

boundary "the hourly clock that\nrebuilds the prices" as CRON <<scheduler>>
participant "nMF, the money engine" as nmf_monetization
boundary "price project #2; EU" as PriceProject
actor "the seller" as Seller
participant "portfolio value,\nrecomputed on every\nprice change" as portfoliovalue
participant "invoicearchive" as invoicearchive

== Rebuild the price list ==

CRON -> nmf_monetization : fires the hourly refresh
nmf_monetization -> PriceProject : resolve the template prices [POST /pricing/resolve]
nmf_monetization -> nmf_monetization : writes the pricing
nmf_monetization ->> nmf_monetization : notifies "pricing.PricesChanged"

== Seller reads their portfolio value ==

group 1: when Seller opens the portfolio page
Seller -> portfoliovalue : opens the portfolio page
portfoliovalue -> nmf_monetization : the price list [getPrices]
nmf_monetization --> portfoliovalue : returns the price list
portfoliovalue -> portfoliovalue : computes the value
invoicearchive -> invoicearchive : files the snapshot
end
group 2: when portfoliovalue listens "pricing.PricesChanged"
nmf_monetization ->> portfoliovalue : pricing.PricesChanged
portfoliovalue -> portfoliovalue : recomputes every portfolio
end

@enduml